  era: "Section 25 \xB7 Gandhian Era \xB7 1917 \u2013 1947"
  title: Champaran Satyagraha, 1917
  text: In 1917 Gandhi took up the cause of indigo farmers in Champaran, Bihar, who were forced to grow indigo under the tinkathia system. His first satyagraha in India led to an inquiry and relief for the peasants.
